# 2. PRODUCT VISION

We are building an AI-powered Interior Design and Shopping Assistant.

The application allows ordinary people to become their own interior designers without requiring professional interior design knowledge.

The core concept:

**Upload a room photo → AI understands the room → AI designs the room → AI identifies furniture → AI finds real products → AI generates shopping recommendations → User purchases products through integrated e-commerce affiliate links.**

The application should combine the capabilities of:

- An AI Interior Designer.
- An AI Shopping Assistant.
- An Interior Design Visualization Tool.
- An E-commerce Product Discovery Engine.
- An Affiliate Commerce Platform.

The product is not intended to become another conventional e-commerce marketplace.

Its primary differentiator is that users can visualize how real purchasable products will look inside their actual rooms before deciding to buy them.

The application should make interior design accessible to everyone.

Users should not need expensive interior designers, complicated design software, or extensive furniture research.

